### ================= BUSCAS DO ANALISTA (cobre SP e DF) =================

### Texto livre: acha A (marca na descrição) e B (marca no título). C está no RJ e D é rascunho -> 200, total 2
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Filtro por status -> 200, total 2
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&status=SUBMITTED
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Filtro por tipo de serviço -> 200, total 1 (B)
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&serviceType=MAINTENANCE
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Filtro por prioridade -> 200, total 1 (B)
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&priority=HIGH
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Filtro por UF dentro da cobertura -> 200, total 1 (B, em DF)
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&state=DF
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### UF FORA da cobertura: o state só restringe, então não vaza nada -> 200, total 0
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&state=RJ
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Pedir rascunhos explicitamente continua dando vazio -> 200, total 0
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&status=DRAFT
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Intervalo de datas (sobre a data de envio, em UTC) incluindo hoje -> 200, total 2
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&dateFrom={{today}}&dateTo={{today}}
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Intervalo de datas no passado -> 200, total 0
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&dateFrom=2000-01-01&dateTo=2000-01-02
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Paginação, página 0 de tamanho 1 -> 200, 1 item, total 2
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&size=1&page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Paginação, página 1 -> 200, 1 item, total 2
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&size=1&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Paginação, página além do fim -> 200, 0 itens, total 2
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&size=1&page=2
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Ordenação por valor estimado, crescente (A antes de B) -> 200
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&sort=estimatedValue,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Ordenação por valor estimado, decrescente (B antes de A) -> 200
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&sort=estimatedValue,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### ================= PARÂMETROS INVÁLIDOS =================

### size 0 -> 400, VALIDATION_ERROR com fieldErrors
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?size=0
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### size acima de 100 -> 400
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?size=101
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Ordenar por um campo não permitido -> 400
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?sort=title,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### UF inexistente -> 400
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?state=XX
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Status desconhecido -> 400
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?status=NOPE
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### ================= QUEM PODE BUSCAR =================

### O ADMIN busca em todas as UFs (A, B e C), mas continua sem ver o rascunho -> 200, total 3
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### O ADMIN também pode restringir por UF -> 200, total 1 (C)
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}&state=RJ
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### CLIENT não busca -> 403
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

### Sem token -> 401
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/search?q={{tag}}
